# P17 QA advisory artifacts (generated, not baseline — IP-dependent)
docs/qa/cta-opaque.md

# Hero videos — six Pexels-licensed Tampa-area aerial drone clips
# (downtown, beaches, pier, city). Free for commercial use, no
# attribution required. Tracked in git so GitHub Pages serves them
# directly. Single-file limit 100 MB; tampa-5.mp4 is 89 MB.
# If repo size becomes a problem, move to a CDN (Bunny/Cloudflare
# Stream) and update assets/video paths in index.html.

